me play & hatch the perfect plot to fly your way past everything, Shooting guns, lasers & other special powers that you can only get your hands on, in this amazingly thought of, well executed & one of the best shooting games out there for this niche of a platform. HOLD YOUR BREATH! AS WE PRESENT TO YOU \u201cVyom- The Combat\u201d. ", "short_description": "Shoot your way out of the biggest Asteroid belt, protecting your spaceship & finding a way out of the rocky mess, alive. Get amazed by the jaw dropping & eye popping reality effects & graphics that work seamlessly in tandem with the easy to get a hang of controls and be the one to change the course of your fate forever. Smash\u2019em, beat\u2019em, crack\u2019em or whack\u2019em, do whatever pleases your guts & vent out your anger in a way it shall be best utilized. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.ojasvr.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.ojasvr.com/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Ojas VR Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.ojasvr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["RACING", "ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "SIMULATION", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "964958334398610"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 8, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "461532911459005"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "400733927042716"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "462078900896343"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1552908634742636"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "i